{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Escape from the Cursed Convent",
    "steam_appid": 1142740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/0fd7b216b93f9a1c7a6298c9df7e1c23.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Escape from the Cursed Convent&quot;</strong> is a narrative adventure game set in a medieval convent and it is a non official fan derivative work of the manga &quot;Hengoku no Schwester.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/c05948ac18a7661e9959633788a12431.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/fe64df21fc16bd02c12e635e567d952a.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Step into the 16th-century Holy Roman Empire through the eyes of Adeline, a young peasant girl whose mother is falsely accused of witchcraft. Adeline is sent to the Claustrum Convent for &quot;re-education&quot; where she faces a living hell of torment and executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the course of five to ten hours, explore the convent\u2019s dark world featuring subtle elements of gore and yuri. Determined to escape, Adeline and her friend Helena embark on a daring journey driven by themes of saintliness, freedom, and faith. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/32551b96ffbb96c6510d671242b09376.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/67fe02a0fedf2627d614fabeced21f5e.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Step into a mesmerizing pixel art world rich with authentic medieval religious details. Explore the beautifully crafted convent accompanied by period-specific music and a cast of intriguing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/c07113a6811e5cdebc65aade2a37b176.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/4280518c5c45fd520e0520e2510663fb.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Embark on an adventure spanning 3 to 5 hours where your choices influence the narrative. Experience multiple endings and side stories as you navigate the convent's mysteries. Form deep, perhaps unexpected connections with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/f008ecf1706286e7e75f555d1022dfc3.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/208a01d07d83ef8c009d2efe6286e01b.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Enhance your journey with a variety of mini-games. Engage in Quick Time Events, test your skills in hunting, perfect your cooking, and discover many more activities as you explore the world with your protagonists.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/0fd7b216b93f9a1c7a6298c9df7e1c23.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Escape from the Cursed Convent&quot;</strong> is a narrative adventure game set in a medieval convent and it is a non official fan derivative work of the manga &quot;Hengoku no Schwester.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/c05948ac18a7661e9959633788a12431.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/fe64df21fc16bd02c12e635e567d952a.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Step into the 16th-century Holy Roman Empire through the eyes of Adeline, a young peasant girl whose mother is falsely accused of witchcraft. Adeline is sent to the Claustrum Convent for &quot;re-education&quot; where she faces a living hell of torment and executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the course of five to ten hours, explore the convent\u2019s dark world featuring subtle elements of gore and yuri. Determined to escape, Adeline and her friend Helena embark on a daring journey driven by themes of saintliness, freedom, and faith. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/32551b96ffbb96c6510d671242b09376.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/67fe02a0fedf2627d614fabeced21f5e.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Step into a mesmerizing pixel art world rich with authentic medieval religious details. Explore the beautifully crafted convent accompanied by period-specific music and a cast of intriguing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/c07113a6811e5cdebc65aade2a37b176.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/4280518c5c45fd520e0520e2510663fb.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Embark on an adventure spanning 3 to 5 hours where your choices influence the narrative. Experience multiple endings and side stories as you navigate the convent's mysteries. Form deep, perhaps unexpected connections with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/f008ecf1706286e7e75f555d1022dfc3.webp?t=1748026536\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142740/extras/208a01d07d83ef8c009d2efe6286e01b.avif?t=1748026536\" /></div>Enhance your journey with a variety of mini-games. Engage in Quick Time Events, test your skills in hunting, perfect your cooking, and discover many more activities as you explore the world with your protagonists.</p>",
